Build 037 (from 033-036: the pool runs out entering Kokiri Forest with the guest's memory full
slots; the user asked for the emulator's graphics memory as small as possible, the game to have it):
- The upload stream buffer's size comes from EDEN_NX2_STREAM_BUFFER_MIB (8..256; headless/main.cpp:
  32 on the console, stream-buffer-mib.txt; 128 before).
- (headless/main.cpp) VMA blocks 8 MiB by default on the console (16 before; vma-block-mib.txt).
- (headless/heap_arenas.inc) heap census: EDEN_HEAP_CENSUS / EDEN_HEAP_SITE on stderr every 30 s
  and when the heap takes a piece; EDEN_NX2_HEAP_CENSUS_OFF disables it.

diff --git a/src/video_core/renderer_vulkan/vk_staging_buffer_pool.cpp b/src/video_core/renderer_vulkan/vk_staging_buffer_pool.cpp
